msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 개통식 날에는 ⟪k:1⟫모든 신대륙 사람들이 열광했다고 합니다. ⟪k:2⟫하지만 야코포는 ⟪k:3⟫전신"
"을 받고도 미소 한 번 짓질 못 했습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_383C8844_8D4C_4391_8D58_066B56908012
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54da9641c195a33e2691d1cac17e5cc9556fa3380e8bd6d19bd80319998a5c36
#. default-sha256: 5387e2f16306a0f11487787757c904c886778ca8b3a71e4b9307b4466f9d3254
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_383C8844_8D4C_4391_8D58_066B56908012"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And I am sure you can take a guess as to why. ⟪k:1⟫The people with whom he wished to share "
"that moment were not there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……이유는 ⟪k:1⟫잘 아시겠지요? ⟪k:2⟫예……, ⟪k:3⟫함께 웃고 싶던 이가 ⟪k:4⟫그 누구도 곁에 ⟪k:5⟫있"
"지 않았거든요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5224486A_9E1D_47CA_9EF1_AAFEBAFC0F8F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 262a7c74ab47ffeea911b6c967d50a69d2fa2986eb3eff4cbee1a25774337727
#. default-sha256: 64fe6750a96c9e1833e330f882db3865b888db2b2bcc28b8d21f2438950ccd59
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5224486A_9E1D_47CA_9EF1_AAFEBAFC0F8F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Shortly following her death, Jacopo held a private funeral for Maria. ⟪k:1⟫Then, he "
"commenced a search for the White-Haired Girl."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫야코포가 맨 먼저 한 행동은 ⟪k:1⟫마리아의 비밀리 장례식과――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫백발 소녀 수색이었습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A1D3D806_78F0_4920_A88A_223A680E8CD4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59f2c84bcf29d8510eff3722d65c53a3c383aad95d179b1e1f000d1c8888a1b5
#. default-sha256: c3102362d0e70006185ec08c1f2a3fd77a41d302797c7330594224bb0fd69a6c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A1D3D806_78F0_4920_A88A_223A680E8CD4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But he did not do so alone—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫he hired others to help, did everything in his power to "
"find her, tirelessly searching for many, many years."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫자기 발로 뛰고, ⟪k:1⟫다른 사람도 부리며―― 가능한 건 다 했습니다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫오랜 세월을 들여 "
"⟪k:4⟫포기하지 않고 수색했지요……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3A5B0260_4BEF_4255_A2A2_1EF512A712D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f70f84ac94758f75dd5a91c19eed7959ca3521442c302f0512f66deb9d83a7ae
#. default-sha256: b2927d5677b57a545af9817593aba02b71a31d8efb242031e3fbcfb1fbb33474
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3A5B0260_4BEF_4255_A2A2_1EF512A712D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, he never was able to locate her..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫결국 ⟪k:2⟫백발 소녀는 발견되지 않았으며――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_747019C5_BC7E_41AE_80E0_782A494BD804
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1492223a228d87ffb652c7008498405bec6ce91df12c96f63daf9a68069af6cd
#. default-sha256: 8471e56079dec3d5afcc8aa98ac67d52fbad8185896ef9e490582d1e734d345f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_747019C5_BC7E_41AE_80E0_782A494BD804"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and he spent the remainder of his life alone."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫야코포는 ⟪k:1⟫홀로 여생을 마쳤습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_038F3D17_FFA7_49DC_B250_DAF31C840EC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72e04c0782c33e02b74a657250d0d36615b4b5a28c29548d4440a741657e40bc
#. default-sha256: 0e31818bb5829eeda31695bc0984b2a1d876bd54c4db329984fd1a59b295115d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_038F3D17_FFA7_49DC_B250_DAF31C840EC8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Money. Power. Renown. Servants.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The world around him was always quite lively..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫돈, ⟪k:1⟫권력, ⟪k:2⟫명성, ⟪k:3⟫추종자…….⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫야코포의 주위는 늘 북적거렸으나――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_367A4258_929D_4544_95B4_2DDB91CC1FEA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80be616657d67919b108391ecf87afd8664bffb14d243370e475104160f7873d
#. default-sha256: 4876840414c2fd4e24ee3fcb0b336335f47edfdaf62d91cbd86c3675ac7f3d52
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_367A4258_929D_4544_95B4_2DDB91CC1FEA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but solitude was his only companion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 심상은 ⟪k:1⟫늘 ⟪k:2⟫고독했습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C102CBAD_7111_4B88_99A6_898FA43ACAD7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40d449064bc1626387d21e52debfac5b51bd0df2396f3e1a71ea58d8dba8a0e6
#. default-sha256: 8d5c9795bdba1ed2a7b7bd8a75f93615e8d70a425921dcc8a76cf2c4d7cb0ff9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C102CBAD_7111_4B88_99A6_898FA43ACAD7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He waited, and he waited, and he waited for the White-Haired Girl to return."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫평생을 고독하게 ⟪k:1⟫백발 소녀만 기다리다―― 나이를 먹어……,"

#: scenario3:scenario3_FC98BB8F_7881_42C9_96FA_30DB641620D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0085372f92dbb7e9495f3702b751d6917b38593e139b169930aef76f3c0edafa
#. default-sha256: 70764510339d26c5cd99e55b4fe033bdf757b9a20d10c4c357224ddc8765c093
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FC98BB8F_7881_42C9_96FA_30DB641620D0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The years crawled by, and with no family or loved ones at his side to care for him in old "
"age, he died alone."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫임종을 지켜볼 가족과 ⟪k:1⟫사랑하는 이 하나 없이.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫홀로 ⟪k:4⟫세상을 떠났지요."
